{"id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-normal-box-lifting.md","title":"Finite Conjunction and Box Lifting","display":"lem-normal-box-lifting — Finite Conjunction and Box Lifting","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","aliases":["89-lem-normal-box-lifting"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-normal-box-lifting — Finite Conjunction and Box Lifting","depends_on":["[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-normal-box-lifting</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-normal-box-lifting — Finite Conjunction and Box Lifting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_*(\\Delta)\">\\(\\Box_*(\\Delta)\\)</span> 为逐项加盒的有限序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle=\\top\">\\(\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle=\\top\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}normal\\text{-}box\\text{-}lifting}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\Box\\bigwedge\\Delta\\leftrightarrow\\bigwedge\\Box_*(\\Delta))\\in L,\\\\\n&amp;(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to A)\\in L\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n(\\bigwedge\\Box_*(\\Delta)\\to\\Box A)\\in L.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}normal\\text{-}box\\text{-}lifting}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\Box\\bigwedge\\Delta\\leftrightarrow\\bigwedge\\Box_*(\\Delta))\\in L,\\\\\n&amp;(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to A)\\in L\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n(\\bigwedge\\Box_*(\\Delta)\\to\\Box A)\\in L.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 6–7；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>二元素分配式用 K 公理、必然化合取投影和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)\">\\(A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)\\)</span> 得到。对序列长度归纳；空序列用必然化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。第二式必然化给定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 定理并用 K 与第一式。反复应用同一论证允许在任意有限盒层数下搬运定理及有限合取；它没有对世界集合中的假设施用必然化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_*(\\Delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle=\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}normal\\text{-}box\\text{-}lifting}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\Box\\bigwedge\\Delta\\leftrightarrow\\bigwedge\\Box_*(\\Delta))\\in L,\\\\\n&(\\bigwedge\\Delta\\to A)\\in L\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n(\\bigwedge\\Box_*(\\Delta)\\to\\Box A)\\in L.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1324,"backlinks":[{"id":"f530ad4c65761317","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4f2c4a3e09c03374","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e46af049d0ea6278","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f40c827a0ffac0b4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb03b454c0564b96","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a668d880013388bd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce272d08b1c31931","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]"}],"outgoing":["bdef52f3ff411531","ca21b68a25f1afc2"]}